  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/1306204747/electron-final</id>
    <updated>2026-09-19T19:24:35Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/avanrossum/cc-command-center/releases/tag/electron-final"/>
    <title>electron-final: Final state of the Electron implementation.</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Stable release:  v0.24.1     (2026-07-30)&lt;br&gt;
Beta release:    v0.24.2-beta.1 (2026-08-03)&lt;br&gt;
Unreleased here: 16 commits, never built, signed or installed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Registry schema at user_version 18. See docs/STATE-OF-THE-APP.md for the&lt;br&gt;
feature inventory with verification levels, the Claude Code coupling surface,&lt;br&gt;
and the gotchas worth inheriting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Swift port begins after this point.&lt;/p&gt;</content>
