  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/1306204747/pre-voice-2026-09-01</id>
    <updated>2026-09-01T19:00:49Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/avanrossum/cc-command-center/releases/tag/pre-voice-2026-09-01"/>
    <title>pre-voice-2026-09-01: Rollback point before the voice-input / local-model work.</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Known-good state, all verified this session:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;commit&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;https://github.com/avanrossum/cc-command-center/commit/0184ba73b86d0ce755465155cabf19ff736c4bc8/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/avanrossum/cc-command-center/commit/0184ba73b86d0ce755465155cabf19ff736c4bc8&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;0184ba7&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt; recent-folder height&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;commit&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;https://github.com/avanrossum/cc-command-center/commit/1fc21c71e8f240d0ded08f1f8f19eb60947b4543/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/avanrossum/cc-command-center/commit/1fc21c71e8f240d0ded08f1f8f19eb60947b4543&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;1fc21c7&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt; bulk cleanup UI (multi-select, select-all-like-this, archive/remove)&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;commit&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;https://github.com/avanrossum/cc-command-center/commit/966a7d2003f47a03e5313ad23542b971600823d4/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/avanrossum/cc-command-center/commit/966a7d2003f47a03e5313ad23542b971600823d4&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;966a7d2&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt; soft archive + registry v18&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;commit&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;https://github.com/avanrossum/cc-command-center/commit/e2ac1b57edbd4cbdd53f13840c6da4452a2114cc/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/avanrossum/cc-command-center/commit/e2ac1b57edbd4cbdd53f13840c6da4452a2114cc&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;e2ac1b5&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt; permission gate + CSP&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;commit&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;https://github.com/avanrossum/cc-command-center/commit/43b1d55bd4e3060e3b3138d92364bfe5b1babae4/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/avanrossum/cc-command-center/commit/43b1d55bd4e3060e3b3138d92364bfe5b1babae4&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;43b1d55&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt; / &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;commit&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;https://github.com/avanrossum/cc-command-center/commit/1a5a6be7a5be67aa33271fd143fb2b773fcdfea0/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/avanrossum/cc-command-center/commit/1a5a6be7a5be67aa33271fd143fb2b773fcdfea0&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;1a5a6be&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt; background agents&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roll back with: git reset --hard pre-voice-2026-09-01&lt;br&gt;
Registry note: v18 has already been applied to any profile that launched this&lt;br&gt;
build. Rolling the CODE back below v18 is safe (the column is simply unused),&lt;br&gt;
but the DB does not roll back.&lt;/p&gt;</content>
